            </>
          ) : isServiceAreaListing ? (
            <>
              Pick a town first, then compare it with the right locksmith solution on our <a href="/services/" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline">services page</a>. If you want to read more before calling, the <a href="/blog/" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline">blog</a> has practical lock and key tips for homeowners, drivers, and business owners.
            </>
          ) : isBlogListing || isArticle ? (
